Description: Selviana Desktop Environment - small, fast and modern desktop
 SDE (Selviana Desktop Environment) is a lightweight desktop environment
 for Debian and Ubuntu, written from scratch in C++17 with FLTK, cairo
 and Xlib, using Openbox as its window manager.
 .
 This 0.1 Alpha release contains:
  * sde-session  - session manager with crash recovery and XDG autostart
  * sde-panel    - taskbar, searchable application menu, tray and clock
  * sde-desktop  - wallpaper and desktop icons
  * sde-settings - light/dark theme, accent color, icons, fonts, wallpaper
  * sde-run      - run command dialog (Alt+F2)
  * sde-logout   - log out, lock, suspend, restart and shut down
 .
 Select "SDE" in your display manager to start it. This is an alpha
 release meant for testing; expect missing features.
